fa74c6c6"}, "language": "english", "review": "This game is pure enjoyment.  It makes me forget about the terrible groin injury I had while looting a Food Giant.  I may never be able to love a woman again, but I can at least have fun playing Gunfire Reborn.", "timestamp_created": 1595543825, "timestamp_updated": 1595543825, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "73180136", "author": {"steamid": "76561198280699539", "personaname": "Datora", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198280699539/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 151, "playtime_forever": 2817, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1256, "last_played": 1683023324, "avatar": "874ff26867ae56d28f0d7099387649d073ca8567"}, "language": "english", "review": "Didn't expected to spent so much time with this game, and oh boy, i was so wrong. \n\nTLDR: Rogue-like FPS with good pacing, fun weapons with nice impact on enemies, many (and fun) items that define your build and permanent buffs while profile leveling.\n\nP.S. This game is getting better and better! Kudos to devs <3", "timestamp_created": 1595540821, "timestamp_updated": 1606333733, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "73179472", "author": {"steamid": "76561198041893438", "personaname": "L10NHUN73R", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/fnbates/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 2199, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1366, "last_played": 1597936041, "avatar": "8dfe278c7493b6984540e57ecd57b791df13841e"}, "language": "english", "review": "The Gunplay is amazing\n", "timestamp_created": 1595539612, "timestamp_updated": 1595539612, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "73178576", "author": {"steamid": "76561198086651377", "personaname": "Winkieee", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198086651377/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 9, "playtime_forever": 5826, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 966, "last_played": 1664466479, "avatar": "b3874cbdfa2daea1e80074c26b60dfaa36bf17ca"}, "language": "english", "review": "very goodest game", "timestamp_created": 1595538063, "timestamp_updated": 1595538063, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "73178169", "author": {"steamid": "76561198079280157", "personaname": "violinnickt", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198079280157/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 1451, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1077, "last_played": 1603806652, "avatar": "fef49e7fa7e1997310d705b2a6158ff8dc1cdfeb"}, "language": "english", "review": "Best FPS roguelite I have ever played", "timestamp_created": 1595537337, "timestamp_updated": 1595537337, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "73171594", "author": {"steamid": "76561198415745796", "personaname": "Noribe", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198415745796/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 8, "playtime_forever": 7301, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1586, "last_played": 1782059567, "avatar": "e1dde7fe207a397634580d4755f7890ccf24ddd7"}, "language": "english", "review": "Good game especially for the price tag 10/10", "timestamp_created": 1595526605, "timestamp_updated": 1595526605, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "73169690", "author": {"steamid": "76561198005833046", "personaname": "Citizen", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/CitizenTay/", "num_games_owned": 810, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 7940, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3382, "last_played": 1785357096, "avatar": "a01e0a75e3f9914315f885ebc6348d1b988cf9f9"}, "language": "english", "review": "I picked this up when I received an accidental request to play it. My friends already had a lot of hours. I jumped in and was heavily under-levelled compared to them but I felt as if I was still contributing to damage and progression. I then grinded some more, sometimes by myself and sometimes with friends, and I found myself grinding and grinding until max level. For an early access game, I couldn't recommend it enough. I've lagged once and that was the host's internet lagging, not on the game. The developers are quick to respond to emails and accept feedback on their game and I can't wait to grind even more. 10/10", "timestamp_created": 1595523459, "timestamp_updated": 1595523459, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.476190477609634399", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "73169089", "author": {"steamid": "76561197999373361", "personaname": "Ozzman", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/ozzmanthe1st/", "num_games_owned": 2200, "num_reviews": 16, "playtime_forever": 13125, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 818, "last_played": 1717698801, "avatar": "5e6d5dc294a4708648b29cc0a9795edc3d3463b3"}, "language": "english", "review": "TLDR: Game is ♥♥♥♥♥♥♥ amazing, buy it.\n\nI can't believe this is an early access game, it feels like a full game. Very very excited to see what the future brings for this game.\nIt's super cheap considering what you get, hours on hours of single or coop fun.\nOne of the best games of 2020, in my book. You'd be a fool not to try this. \nSo if you are into Roguelites and a game you always return to, this is the game for you!", "timestamp_created": 1595522485, "timestamp_updated": 1595535477, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.525862038135528564", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "73166106", "author": {"steamid": "76561198093155191", "personaname": "Pawnable", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198093155191/", "num_games_owned": 341, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 6109, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1727, "last_played": 1789021310, "avatar": "459ad9c89800fd333db900a7db6a237edee383fb"}, "language": "english", "review": "TL:DR  more fun with friends, better strategy too\n\nThis game was introduced to me by youtuber solodoublej, and i have not been disappointed... me and my friend (up to 4 players) have been going ham on this game when im home and not working lol.. and its super fun. playing solo just kinda feels like grinding for levels, but still fun to see new things as u go. we play alot all at once and really enjoy it. i think they do a good job at making this game challenging enough to make u want to get past that one part, yet fun enough that makes u want to keep playing even if u lose the round. that being said, its early access, so theres less content than i want there to be... still its not bad at all... there are almost no bugs... like... i dont even think ive seen one. when i first started out playing, my framerate was hitchy, but i havent noticed that in a while... so... on to the bad stuff, which honestly, isnt much. its a random based game and sometimes u get poopied on... but u can still get thru it, and feel fulfilled in the end... more stuff is needed, honestly its worth 12 or 13 bucks... as is rn its worth that. but i would love to see more, maybe different stage selects as there is only one u can choose (and by one i mean u start in one stage and advance to a harder stage after a boss... but u dont get to select any stage at all.)on top of that,, i find myself stiching to one weapon (prism) and my friend sticking to one as well (thunderclap gloves) and this combo seems unbeatable. so balancing may be an issue, but im no game dev. the other guns just dont seem as fun to me so that may be personal opinion. hit boxes are the biggest problem and def need tweaked... i could smack someone in the face point blank and it wouldnt count as a crit... and some hitboxes seem really small. i should be saying crit boxes... bc i have no problem hitting them... at all but sometimes im hitting them in the head and nothing happens... idk y... so hitboxes for crits are my biggest problem... so to break it down:\n\nPros:\n-Super fun overall\n-pretty good graphics\n-good balance of rewarding and challenging\n-great with friends\n-few bugs (if any)\n-def a 12 or 13 dollar game id prob pay like 20 for it honestly...\n\nCons:\n-crit hit boxes suck\n-not a huge amount of content as far as level selection or hero selection\n-kinda feels like u only want to use one gun...\n\nworth the buy... cant wait to see where this game goes, ill be playing it for a long time i hope", "timestamp_created": 1595518152, "timestamp_updated": 1595518152, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": []}]}